    "html": "<p class=\"standard-p\">The default input structure is:</p>\n<div class=\"standard-code-block\" data-lang=\"tree\">\n  <div class=\"code-block-header\">\n    <span class=\"code-lang-label\">TREE</span>\n    <button class=\"code-copy-button\" onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" title=\"Copy to clipboard\">\n      <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg>\n      <span class=\"copy-text\">Copy</span>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n  <pre><code class=\"language-tree\">project/\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> wav/\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> <span class=\"code-wav\">speech1.wav</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> <span class=\"code-wav\">speech2.wav</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> hindi/\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> speaker001/\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> <span class=\"code-wav\">001.wav</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">└──</span> <span class=\"code-wav\">002.wav</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">└──</span> speaker002/\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>       <span class=\"code-tree\">└──</span> <span class=\"code-wav\">001.wav</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">└──</span> ...\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> noise/\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> gunshot/\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> <span class=\"code-wav\">noise001.wav</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">└──</span> <span class=\"code-wav\">noise002.wav</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> vehicle/\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> <span class=\"code-wav\">vehicle001.wav</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">└──</span> <span class=\"code-wav\">vehicle002.wav</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">└──</span> ...\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">└──</span> generate_dataset.py</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p class=\"standard-p\">The directories do not have to be this exact shape internally.</p>\n<p class=\"standard-p\">Both <code class=\"inline-code\">wav/</code> and <code class=\"inline-code\">noise/</code> are scanned recursively.</p>\n<p class=\"standard-p\">The default extensions are:</p>\n<div class=\"standard-code-block\" data-lang=\"json\">\n  <div class=\"code-block-header\">\n    <span class=\"code-lang-label\">JSON</span>\n    <button class=\"code-copy-button\" onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" title=\"Copy to clipboard\">\n      <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg>\n      <span class=\"copy-text\">Copy</span>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n  <pre><code class=\"language-json\">[&quot;.wav&quot;, &quot;.flac&quot;]</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p class=\"standard-p\">Other extensions can be added through the configuration.</p>\n<hr class=\"section-divider\" />",
