    "summary": "Generate 1,000 training samples: Equivalent standalone command: Generate using a custom root: Specify the output directory: Specify a configuration file: Overri...",
    "html": "<p class=\"standard-p\">Generate 1,000 training samples:</p>\n<div class=\"standard-code-block\" data-lang=\"bash\">\n  <div class=\"code-block-header\">\n    <span class=\"code-lang-label\">BASH</span>\n    <button class=\"code-copy-button\" onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" title=\"Copy to clipboard\">\n      <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg>\n      <span class=\"copy-text\">Copy</span>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n  <pre><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"code-kw\">python</span> -m <span class=\"code-target\">noisygen</span> <span class=\"code-flag\">--num-samples</span> 1000</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p class=\"standard-p\">Equivalent standalone command:</p>\n<div class=\"standard-code-block\" data-lang=\"bash\">\n  <div class=\"code-block-header\">\n    <span class=\"code-lang-label\">BASH</span>\n    <button class=\"code-copy-button\" onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" title=\"Copy to clipboard\">\n      <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg>\n      <span class=\"copy-text\">Copy</span>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n  <pre><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"code-kw\">python</span> <span class=\"code-target\">generate_dataset.py</span> <span class=\"code-flag\">--num-samples</span> 1000</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p class=\"standard-p\">Generate using a custom root:</p>\n<div class=\"standard-code-block\" data-lang=\"bash\">\n  <div class=\"code-block-header\">\n    <span class=\"code-lang-label\">BASH</span>\n    <button class=\"code-copy-button\" onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" title=\"Copy to clipboard\">\n      <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg>\n      <span class=\"copy-text\">Copy</span>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n  <pre><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"code-kw\">python</span> -m <span class=\"code-target\">noisygen</span> <span class=\"code-flag\">--root</span> /path/to/project <span class=\"code-flag\">--num-samples</span> 1000</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p class=\"standard-p\">Specify the output directory:</p>\n<div class=\"standard-code-block\" data-lang=\"bash\">\n  <div class=\"code-block-header\">\n    <span class=\"code-lang-label\">BASH</span>\n    <button class=\"code-copy-button\" onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" title=\"Copy to clipboard\">\n      <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg>\n      <span class=\"copy-text\">Copy</span>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n  <pre><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"code-kw\">python</span> -m <span class=\"code-target\">noisygen</span> \\\n\n    <span class=\"code-flag\">--root</span> /path/to/project \\\n\n    <span class=\"code-flag\">--output</span> /path/to/dataset \\\n\n    <span class=\"code-flag\">--num-samples</span> 1000</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p class=\"standard-p\">Specify a configuration file:</p>\n<div class=\"standard-code-block\" data-lang=\"bash\">\n  <div class=\"code-block-header\">\n    <span class=\"code-lang-label\">BASH</span>\n    <button class=\"code-copy-button\" onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" title=\"Copy to clipboard\">\n      <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg>\n      <span class=\"copy-text\">Copy</span>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n  <pre><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"code-kw\">python</span> -m <span class=\"code-target\">noisygen</span> \\\n\n    <span class=\"code-flag\">--config</span> config.json \\\n\n    <span class=\"code-flag\">--num-samples</span> 10000</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p class=\"standard-p\">Override the seed:</p>\n<div class=\"standard-code-block\" data-lang=\"bash\">\n  <div class=\"code-block-header\">\n    <span class=\"code-lang-label\">BASH</span>\n    <button class=\"code-copy-button\" onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" title=\"Copy to clipboard\">\n      <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg>\n      <span class=\"copy-text\">Copy</span>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n  <pre><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"code-kw\">python</span> -m <span class=\"code-target\">noisygen</span> \\\n\n    <span class=\"code-flag\">--seed</span> 12345 \\\n\n    <span class=\"code-flag\">--num-samples</span> 10000</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p class=\"standard-p\">Use a specific number of worker processes:</p>\n<div class=\"standard-code-block\" data-lang=\"bash\">\n  <div class=\"code-block-header\">\n    <span class=\"code-lang-label\">BASH</span>\n    <button class=\"code-copy-button\" onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" title=\"Copy to clipboard\">\n      <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg>\n      <span class=\"copy-text\">Copy</span>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n  <pre><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"code-kw\">python</span> -m <span class=\"code-target\">noisygen</span> \\\n\n    <span class=\"code-flag\">--workers</span> 8 \\\n\n    <span class=\"code-flag\">--num-samples</span> 10000</code></pre>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"section-divider\" />",
