    "html": "<p class=\"standard-p\">A normal generated dataset looks like:</p>\n<div class=\"standard-code-block\" data-lang=\"tree\">\n  <div class=\"code-block-header\">\n    <span class=\"code-lang-label\">TREE</span>\n    <button class=\"code-copy-button\" onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" title=\"Copy to clipboard\">\n      <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg>\n      <span class=\"copy-text\">Copy</span>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n  <pre><code class=\"language-tree\">output/\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> train/\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> clean/\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> <span class=\"code-wav\">000001.wav</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> <span class=\"code-wav\">000002.wav</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">└──</span> ...\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">└──</span> noisy/\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>       <span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> <span class=\"code-wav\">000001.wav</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>       <span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> <span class=\"code-wav\">000002.wav</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>       <span class=\"code-tree\">└──</span> ...\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> validation/\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> clean/\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">└──</span> noisy/\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> test/\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> clean/\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">└──</span> noisy/\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> metadata/\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> <span class=\"code-json\">dataset_metadata.jsonl</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> <span class=\"code-json\">dataset_summary.json</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> <span class=\"code-json\">run_config.json</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">├──</span> <span class=\"code-json\">source_inventory.json</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>   <span class=\"code-tree\">└──</span> <span class=\"code-json\">failed_attempts.jsonl</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">│</span>\n\n<span class=\"code-tree\">└──</span> .cache/\n\n    <span class=\"code-tree\">└──</span> std48k/</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p class=\"standard-p\">Only splits specified in the configuration are created.</p>\n<hr class=\"section-divider\" />",
    "plainText": "A normal generated dataset looks like: Only splits specified in the configuration are created. ---"
