    "groupOrder": 5,
    "toc": [],
    "summary": "The primary metadata file is: There is exactly one JSON record per successfully generated sample. Example structure: The actual records contain substantially mo...",
    "html": "<p class=\"standard-p\">The primary metadata file is:</p>\n<div class=\"standard-code-block\" data-lang=\"text\">\n  <div class=\"code-block-header\">\n    <span class=\"code-lang-label\">TEXT</span>\n    <button class=\"code-copy-button\" onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" title=\"Copy to clipboard\">\n      <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg>\n      <span class=\"copy-text\">Copy</span>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n  <pre><code class=\"language-text\">metadata/dataset_metadata.jsonl</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p class=\"standard-p\">There is exactly one JSON record per successfully generated sample.</p>\n<p class=\"standard-p\">Example structure:</p>\n<div class=\"standard-code-block\" data-lang=\"json\">\n  <div class=\"code-block-header\">\n    <span class=\"code-lang-label\">JSON</span>\n    <button class=\"code-copy-button\" onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" title=\"Copy to clipboard\">\n      <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg>\n      <span class=\"copy-text\">Copy</span>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n  <pre><code class=\"language-json\">{\n\n    <span class=\"code-key\">&quot;sample_id&quot;</span>: &quot;000001&quot;,\n\n    <span class=\"code-key\">&quot;split&quot;</span>: &quot;train&quot;,\n\n    <span class=\"code-key\">&quot;clean_source&quot;</span>: &quot;wav/speaker/file.wav&quot;,\n\n    <span class=\"code-key\">&quot;clean_output&quot;</span>: &quot;train/clean/000001.wav&quot;,\n\n    <span class=\"code-key\">&quot;noisy_output&quot;</span>: &quot;train/noisy/000001.wav&quot;,\n\n    <span class=\"code-key\">&quot;target_snr_db&quot;</span>: <span class=\"code-num\">10.0</span>,\n\n    <span class=\"code-key\">&quot;measured_snr_db&quot;</span>: <span class=\"code-num\">9.9998</span>,\n\n    <span class=\"code-key\">&quot;snr_error_db&quot;</span>: <span class=\"code-num\">-0.0002</span>,\n\n    <span class=\"code-key\">&quot;composite_noise_scale&quot;</span>: <span class=\"code-num\">0.123</span>,\n\n    <span class=\"code-key\">&quot;output_gain&quot;</span>: <span class=\"code-num\">0.91</span>,\n\n    <span class=\"code-key\">&quot;duration_seconds&quot;</span>: <span class=\"code-num\">8.2</span>,\n\n    <span class=\"code-key\">&quot;sample_rate&quot;</span>: <span class=\"code-num\">48000</span>,\n\n    <span class=\"code-key\">&quot;channels&quot;</span>: <span class=\"code-num\">1</span>,\n\n    <span class=\"code-key\">&quot;output_subtype&quot;</span>: &quot;PCM_16&quot;,\n\n    <span class=\"code-key\">&quot;random_seed&quot;</span>: <span class=\"code-num\">123456789</span>\n\n}</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p class=\"standard-p\">The actual records contain substantially more provenance.</p>\n<hr class=\"section-divider\" />",
    "plainText": "The primary metadata file is: There is exactly one JSON record per successfully generated sample. Example structure: The actual records contain substantially more provenance. ---"
