    "summary": "Each noise entry records information such as: This makes the generated noise reconstructable. ---",
    "html": "<p class=\"standard-p\">Each noise entry records information such as:</p>\n<div class=\"standard-code-block\" data-lang=\"text\">\n  <div class=\"code-block-header\">\n    <span class=\"code-lang-label\">TEXT</span>\n    <button class=\"code-copy-button\" onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" title=\"Copy to clipboard\">\n      <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg>\n      <span class=\"copy-text\">Copy</span>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n  <pre><code class=\"language-text\">source\n\nnoise_dataset\n\nnoise_category\n\nrelative_gain_db\n\nnormalization_rms\n\nstart_sample\n\nend_sample\n\nstart_time_seconds\n\nlooped\n\nchunks\n\nsource_original_sample_rate\n\nsource_original_channels\n\nsource_standardized_num_samples</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p class=\"standard-p\">This makes the generated noise reconstructable.</p>\n<hr class=\"section-divider\" />",
