    "html": "<p class=\"standard-p\">This file records every discovered source.</p>\n<p class=\"standard-p\">It contains separate clean and noise inventories.</p>\n<p class=\"standard-p\">For every source, information includes:</p>\n<div class=\"standard-code-block\" data-lang=\"text\">\n  <div class=\"code-block-header\">\n    <span class=\"code-lang-label\">TEXT</span>\n    <button class=\"code-copy-button\" onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" title=\"Copy to clipboard\">\n      <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg>\n      <span class=\"copy-text\">Copy</span>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n  <pre><code class=\"language-text\">path\n\nsize_bytes\n\nmetadata</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p class=\"standard-p\">Unreadable sources are also explicitly recorded.</p>\n<p class=\"example-lead\"><strong>Example:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"standard-code-block\" data-lang=\"json\">\n  <div class=\"code-block-header\">\n    <span class=\"code-lang-label\">JSON</span>\n    <button class=\"code-copy-button\" onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" title=\"Copy to clipboard\">\n      <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg>\n      <span class=\"copy-text\">Copy</span>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n  <pre><code class=\"language-json\">{\n\n    <span class=\"code-key\">&quot;clean&quot;</span>: [\n\n        {\n\n            <span class=\"code-key\">&quot;path&quot;</span>: &quot;wav/a.wav&quot;,\n\n            <span class=\"code-key\">&quot;size_bytes&quot;</span>: <span class=\"code-num\">1234567</span>\n\n        }\n\n    ],\n\n    <span class=\"code-key\">&quot;noise&quot;</span>: [\n\n        {\n\n            <span class=\"code-key\">&quot;path&quot;</span>: &quot;noise/gunshot/a.wav&quot;,\n\n            <span class=\"code-key\">&quot;size_bytes&quot;</span>: <span class=\"code-num\">234567</span>\n\n        }\n\n    ],\n\n    <span class=\"code-key\">&quot;unreadable&quot;</span>: {\n\n        <span class=\"code-key\">&quot;clean&quot;</span>: [],\n\n        <span class=\"code-key\">&quot;noise&quot;</span>: []\n\n    }\n\n}</code></pre>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"section-divider\" />",
